SUMMARY:Special Event: Janine Harouni
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 2031 Sansom Street\, Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:Janine Harouni is a stand-up comedian\, writer and LAMDA-traine
 d actress with over 860\,000 social followers and more than 160 million vie
 ws of her stand-up online. Her debut on BBC’s  Live at the Apollo became
  one of the most-watched in the show’s history\, amassing over 30 million
  views. In 2026 she reached the finale of the Netflix reboot of Star Search
  . Twice nominated for the Edinburgh Comedy Award\, Janine’s recent show 
 Man’oushe —performed at 8.5 months pregnant—toured internationally\, 
 selling thousands of tickets across the UK\, India\, Dubai\, LA and New Yor
 k.\n\nHer latest show This Is What You Waited For premiered at the 2025 Edi
 nburgh Fringe before transferring to a two week run at London’s Soho Thea
 tre and launching a new international tour across the UK\, North America an
 d Europe.\n\nJanine’s debut hour Stand Up with Janine Harouni (Please Rem
 ain Seated) was nominated for Best Newcomer at the Edinburgh Fringe\, earne
 d 5-star reviews in The Times \, and was highlighted by The New York Times 
 . Originally filmed for Amazon Prime UK\, it is now available on YouTube.\n
 \nOn screen\, Janine has appeared in The Batman \, The People We Hate at th
 e Wedding \, HBO’s The Franchise and Bob’s Burgers \, with forthcoming 
 roles in a new BBC series and Apple TV+’s Trying . She is also part of th
 e writers’ room for Apple TV+’s The Holiday . Janine is based in the UK
 .\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage
  credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement res
 erves the right to prevent customers from entering the facility who they de
 em disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatla
 s.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-janine-harouni/
